[2026-09-26T14:24:12.009+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1] 9. Do not hardcode screenshot data, sample rows, fake success messages, or fallback arrays as completed behavior.
[2026-09-26T14:24:12.009+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1] 10. Return interfaces that make later test generation straightforward: include `file_path`, `first_line`, responsibility, specification, callers/callees, and test focus.
[2026-09-26T14:24:12.009+08:00] [InterfaceDesigner][REQ-1-1-1] 11. The interface `type` must be one of `UI`, `API`, `FUNC`, or `DB`.
