essions schema additions in database/init_db.js, the seed contract in database/seed_db.js, AccountHeader.tsx, and the App.tsx/main.tsx wiring. No file was written twice; no implementation behavior (hashing, cookie session creation, repository CRUD) was implemented in DESIGN.",
