[2026-09-26T14:32:28.448+08:00] [TestGenerator][REQ-1-1-1] 2. Apply this skill to executable leaf-node work. Non-leaf UI/composition nodes may expose auth entry points or shell slots, but they do not design API, FUNC, or DB session contracts.
