[2026-09-26T14:32:28.448+08:00] [TestGenerator][REQ-1-1-1] 5. A registration or login success should update global authenticated state and expose a durable session recovery path.
[2026-09-26T14:32:28.448+08:00] [TestGenerator][REQ-1-1-1] 6. Provide a session-loading API or equivalent runtime boundary when the app needs to restore authenticated state after refresh/navigation.
